'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Parsing an edit request
participant "parser:Parser" as Parser
participant "changes:RecipeChanges" as Changes
participant "edit:EditRecipeCommand" as Edit
Parser -> Parser : parseEditRecipe(arguments)
Parser -> Parser : parseRecipeIndex("2")
Parser -> Parser : collectRecipeArguments(...)
ref over Parser : Validate prefixed fields using shared helpers
Parser -> Parser : parseOptionalNutrition(\nfields, "p", "Protein")
Parser --> Parser : 55
note over Parser
 Omitted scalars stay null.
 Ingredients form a replacement list.
end note
create Changes
Parser -> Changes : new RecipeChanges(\nnull, null, 55, null, null,\ningredients, null)
activate Changes
Changes --> Parser : validated changes
deactivate Changes
create Edit
Parser -> Edit : new EditRecipeCommand(2, changes)
activate Edit
Edit --> Parser : command
deactivate Edit
note over Parser, Edit : No recipe-book lookup while parsing.

@enduml
'@@author
